      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Especializar comportamiento — un system prompt distinto para cada caso\n(ej. security-auditor, exercise-creator, ui-test-writer).",
